<title>JAPAN: NTT sees '96/97 capital spending of 1.98 trln yen.</title>
<headline>NTT sees '96/97 capital spending of 1.98 trln yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp (NTT) said on Friday that it expects capital spending of 1.98 trillion yen in the year to March 31, and of 1.94 trillion yen in 1997/98.</p>
</text>
